aquinas-will-necessary.logic.r3: argue/scope: P3 (S3): read with the necessity on its consequent alone, god_wills → □saved, the conclusion follows, restating it; read with it on the whole conditional, □(god_wills → saved), C (S1) does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
aquinas-will-necessary.logic.r3: argue/scope: P2 (S3): read with the necessity on its consequent alone, god_wills → □saved, the conclusion follows, restating it; read with it on the whole conditional, □(god_wills → saved), the conclusion does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
